# StockWise POS

StockWise POS is a browser-based Point of Sale and inventory management application developed for our Web Systems and Technologies course. The application provides frontend features for managing orders, inventory, customer rewards, reports, notifications, and system settings.

## Milestone 1: Interactive Frontend Web Application

The current milestone focuses on the development of the application's frontend using HTML, CSS, and JavaScript. Interactive features include order processing, inventory management, customer rewards, reports, form validation, notifications, settings, and other user interactions.

